9. Phased Delivery Roadmap


Phase 1 — Foundation (Weeks 1–4)
MCP server scaffold with basic tool definitions
JavaParser integration — scan project, extract class graph
Neo4j local setup and graph schema definition
VS Code extension skeleton with command palette
Basic layer violation detection using ArchUnit

Phase 2 — Architect Intent Ingestion (Weeks 5–8)
PlantUML parser — extract components, relationships, layers
Mermaid parser — same extraction
YAML architecture rule file parser and validator
Intent graph storage in Neo4j
First deviation report: HLD component boundary violations

Phase 3 — Framework Knowledge Base (Weeks 9–13)
Framework JAR ingestion pipeline (bytecode + source JAR)
Claude API integration for framework rule extraction
Framework knowledge graph schema and storage
Requirement-to-pattern mapping engine
Multi-framework support (Spring Boot, Hibernate, Kafka)

Phase 4 — Design Pattern & Coding Standards (Weeks 14–17)
Design pattern structural detection via JavaParser AST
Claude API integration for pattern semantic correctness
Checkstyle + PMD integration for coding standards
Custom YAML coding standard rule support
Anti-pattern detection library

Phase 5 — VS Code Experience (Weeks 18–22)
Full VS Code extension with architecture diagram panel
Problems panel integration with click-to-navigate
Copilot Agent Mode natural language query support
On-save analysis with configurable scope
HTML/Markdown deviation report export

